1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:05,400
Tomorrow you turn 30.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,400
Where did ten years go?

3
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:22,400
Let's go back.

4
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:28,600
At 20, you had dreams.

5
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:34,400
And all the time in the world.

6
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:42,400
"I'll start tomorrow."

7
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,600
Snooze.

8
00:00:52,500 --> 00:00:58,400
Just one more video.

9
00:01:06,200 --> 00:01:07,800
Never sent.

10
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:14,400
Tomorrow became next week.

11
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:21,200
Next week became next year.

12
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:26,600
Everyone moved forward.

13
00:01:27,400 --> 00:01:31,400
You stayed the same.

14
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:37,200
Your dreams didn't die.

15
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:42,400
You just stopped visiting them.

16
00:01:44,000 --> 00:01:48,200
Every day you waited...

17
00:01:48,800 --> 00:01:54,400
is a day you will never get back.

18
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:08,200
How many did you really live?

19
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:14,600
30 candles.

20
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:20,400
And a wish you've made ten times before.

21
00:02:28,000 --> 00:02:35,400
What if you got one more chance?

22
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:41,400
You do. It's called today.

23
00:02:46,600 --> 00:02:49,600
Day 1.

24
00:02:51,500 --> 00:02:58,400
It will hurt.

25
00:03:00,500 --> 00:03:07,400
You will want to quit.

26
00:03:09,500 --> 00:03:16,400
Do it anyway.

27
00:03:18,500 --> 00:03:25,400
One day at a time.

28
00:03:27,500 --> 00:03:33,400
And call your mom.

29
00:03:36,000 --> 00:03:43,200
Make these days count.

30
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:55,600
Your 20s are not a waiting room.

31
00:03:57,800 --> 00:04:02,400
You're not running out of time.

32
00:04:03,800 --> 00:04:08,400
You're running out of excuses.

33
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:15,200
Start today.

